# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Binary media never goes in history.
#
# The repository reached 646 MB because ~620 MB of source video was committed
# before these rules existed - and git keeps every version of a binary forever,
# so a file deleted from the working tree still costs its full size in the pack
# for the life of the project. Everything here lives on disk and is either an
# input to the asset pipeline or an archive.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mp3
*.wav
*.glb
*.fbx
*.skp
*.zip
*.rar
*.blend

# Raw source assets, downloads and archived clutter.
_archive/
Models i have added self/
scifi-watchtower-es/
download/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The exceptions: things the game genuinely cannot run without.
#
# Built models are ~5 MB total and regenerated by tools/build-models.mjs. The
# loading clip is small and is the first thing anyone sees. The trailer is not
# here - it is large, and it is produced from the source video by
# tools/build-video.mjs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!public/models/*.glb
!public/media/kryonis-loading.mp4
